  noteContent: "I watch an unstable atom closely with rapid laser pulses. The more
    I look, the more it freezes \u2014 it refuses to decay. In one Cornell experiment,
    continuous measurement slowed tunneling by a factor of ten. Constant observation
    locks it in a superposition."
